      {
        "id": 2563431,
        "name": "Pierre de Bricassart",
        "username": "Pierre_de_Bricassart",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/pierre_de_bricassart/{size}/386093_2.png",
        "created_at": "2024-07-17T11:21:28.322Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Multiple accounts are OK, as long as they are Omega.<br>\nThere’s several technical gadgets which are not ok (<a href=\"https://support.eveonline.com/hc/en-us/articles/8413329735580-EVE-Online-End-User-License-Agreement\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">see EULA</a>), using these is called botting. But e.g. fleet warp is not part of it.</p>",
