        "created_at": "2024-07-17T13:44:12.172Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://support.eveonline.com/hc/en-us/articles/7370802950172-Botting\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      \n\n      <a href=\"https://support.eveonline.com/hc/en-us/articles/7370802950172-Botting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">EVE Online</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    \n\n<h3><a href=\"https://support.eveonline.com/hc/en-us/articles/7370802950172-Botting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Botting</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Botting is the use of any third-party software or any macros, stored rapid keystrokes or other patterns that give you any in-game advantage. Any in-game data may not be modified, manipulated, or ch...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>This should answer all questions.</p>\n<p>Closed.</p>",
